# Keep the build context small and keep secrets out of it. Anything listed here
# is invisible to `docker build`, including to a `COPY . .` someone adds later.

# Never. The image takes its configuration from the environment at run time;
# a .env baked into a layer is a secret you cannot delete by editing the file.
**/.env
**/.env.local

# Installed inside the image against the lockfile. Copying the host's tree in
# would ship macOS-native binaries to a Linux container.
**/node_modules

# Build output, rebuilt or irrelevant.
extension/build
extension/.plasmo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Not part of the server.
.git
.github
docs
scripts
extension

# Resumes. Nothing under here belongs in an image.
**/*.pdf
